---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Walking with Jesus — daily Christian reflections.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Walking with Jesus</strong> is a simple daily blog of Christian reflections centered on
      the person of Jesus Christ — His life, His teaching, and His love.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each day brings one short article meant to be read slowly: a passage of Scripture, a pastoral
      thought, and a hopeful takeaway you can carry into ordinary life. The tone is warm and reverent,
      never loud — an invitation to draw near, not a lecture from afar.
    </p>
    <p>
      Whether you are curious about Jesus, returning after a long time away, or already walking
      closely with Him, you are welcome here. Come and see.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
